Cases written with the rule (2026-10-13), not drawn from a labeling round.
An inline review comment whose nit or blocking label contradicts its text.
-- hit/review-inline --
nit: this must be guarded by the lock before merge.
Nit: this is a blocker, the build fails without it.
[nitpick] The import order is required by the linter.
blocking: feel free to skip this if you prefer.
suggestion (non-blocking): this must not ship.
issue (blocking): optional, but the name could be clearer.
-- pass/review-inline --
nit: the name could be shorter.
blocking: this races with the writer in cache.go.
This must be guarded by the lock.
nit (non-blocking): trailing space.
Nitpicking here, but the name is long.
